OL,3,AWoman who accuses Russell Brand of rape
OL,4,Asays prison message 'upsetting'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who has made allegations
OL,7,Fagainst Russell Brand has said she
OL,8,Ffinds it "upsetting" and "really
OL,9,Fshocking" that he was able to claim he
OL,10,Fwas innocent from prison, following his
OL,11,Fconviction for rape and sexual assault.
OL,13,FSpeaking after the comedian's wife
OL,14,FLaura read out a message from him on
OL,15,Ftheir Sunday Service show on YouTube,
OL,16,FMia Latter told BBC Radio 4's Today
OL,17,Fprogramme she found it "appalling" to
OL,18,Fhear "this Christian message alongside
OL,19,Fabsolute lies".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
