OL,3,AUS government confirms investigation
OL,4,Ainto tech firm Megaspeed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe United States has confirmed it is
OL,7,Finvestigating computing company
OL,8,FMegaspeed, suspecting it of violating
OL,9,FUS export controls by helping to ship
OL,10,Ftech giant Nvidia's chips to China.
OL,12,FIn a joint statement, the US Department
OL,13,Fof Justice and Department of Commerce
OL,14,Fsaid they had been investigating
OL,15,FSingapore-based firm Megaspeed since
OL,16,F2024.
OL,18,FIt comes after questions were raised
OL,19,Fabout the possibility high-end AI chips
OL,20,Fmay have ended up in China despite US
OL,21,Fexport restrictions.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
